#: behaviour.cpp:46
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Behavior</h1> You can configure how Konqueror behaves as a file "
"manager here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Eşlänüe</h1> Konqueror yazılımı birem idäräçe bularaq,  anıñ "
"eşlänüen monda caylap bula."

#: behaviour.cpp:50
msgid "Misc Options"
msgstr "Başqa Köylämä"

#: behaviour.cpp:66
msgid "Open folders in separate &windows"
msgstr "Törgäklärne ayırım &täräzälärdä aç"

#: behaviour.cpp:67
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, Konqueror will open a new window when you open a "
"folder, rather than showing that folders's contents in the current window."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylanğan bulsa, törgäk açılğan çaqta, Konqueror, ul törgäk eçtälegen açıq "
"täräzädä tügel, yaña täräzädä kürsäter."

#: behaviour.cpp:74
msgid "&Show network operations in a single window"
msgstr "Çeltärle eşlärne ayırım täräzädä kür&sätäse"

#: behaviour.cpp:77
msgid ""
"Checking this option will group the progress information for all network file "
"transfers into a single window with a list. When the option is not checked, all "
"transfers appear in a separate window."
msgstr ""
"Monı tamğalaw böten çeltärdäge biremnär taşıması (transferı) belän bäyle "
"alğarış mäğlümäteneñ ayırım täräzädäge tezemgä tezelüenä kiterer. Bu saylanma "
"tamğasız bulğanda här taşıma (transfer) ayırım täräzädä kürenä."

#: behaviour.cpp:85
msgid "Show file &tips"
msgstr "Birem &kiñäşen kürsätü"

#: behaviour.cpp:88
msgid ""
"Here you can control if, when moving the mouse over a file, you want to see a "
"small popup window with additional information about that file"
msgstr ""
"Monda, berär birem östendä küsene tuqtatqanda, birem turında östämä mäğlümät "
"belän qalquçı täräzä kürsättergän saylanmanı sälätle itärgä bula."

#: behaviour.cpp:108
msgid "Show &previews in file tips"
msgstr "Birem kiñäşendä küreneşen çığaru"

#: behaviour.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Here you can control if you want the popup window to contain a larger preview "
"for the file, when moving the mouse over it."
msgstr ""
"Birem östennän küse belän ütkändä ul birem eçtälegen kürsätkän atılma-täräzä "
"çığaru kiräklegen monda açıp bula."

#: behaviour.cpp:114
msgid "Rename icons in&line"
msgstr "İkon &adın aña çirtep üzgärtäse"

#: behaviour.cpp:115
msgid ""
"Checking this option will allow files to be renamed by clicking directly on the "
"icon name. "
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, ikon östenä çirtü aşa da anıñ adın şunda uq üzgärtep bulaçaq. "

#: behaviour.cpp:121
msgid "Home &URL:"
msgstr "Töp Bit &URLı:"

#: behaviour.cpp:126
msgid "Select Home Folder"
msgstr "Töp Törgäk Saylaw"

#: behaviour.cpp:131
msgid ""
"This is the URL (e.g. a folder or a web page) where Konqueror will jump to when "
"the \"Home\" button is pressed. This is usually your home folder, symbolized by "
"a 'tilde' (~)."
msgstr ""
"Bu \"Başlanğıç\" töymäsenä basqannan soñ konqueror kitkän adres (mäs. berär "
"törgäk yä ki web-säxifä). Ğädättä ul dulqın bilgese (~)."

#: behaviour.cpp:139
msgid "Show 'Delete' context me&nu entries which bypass the trashcan"
msgstr "Çüplekkä cibärmiçä, eş tirädä 'Taşla' saylaq keremnären kürsätäse"

#: behaviour.cpp:143
msgid ""
"Check this if you want 'Delete' menu commands to be displayed on the desktop "
"and in the file manager's context menus. You can always delete files by holding "
"the Shift key while calling 'Move to Trash'."
msgstr ""
"Östäl östendä häm birem citäkçeläre kontekst saylaqlarında 'Taşla' saylaq "
"ämerläreneñ kürsätelüen teläsäñ, monı tamğala. Shift töymäsen basıp 'Çüplekkä "
"taşla' çaqıraraq fayllarnı härwaqıt taşlarğa bula."

#: behaviour.cpp:148
msgid "Ask Confirmation For"
msgstr "Bolar öçen Raslaw Sorísı"

#: behaviour.cpp:150
msgid ""
"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you "
"\"delete\" a file. "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Move To Trash:</em> moves the file to your trash folder, from where it "
"can be recovered very easily.</li> "
"<li><em>Delete:</em> simply deletes the file.</li> </li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Bu saylanma Konqueror'ğa, berär biremne \"taşla\"ğanda nişlärgä kiräklegen "
"kürsätä. "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Çüplekkä Taşla:</em>biremne çüplekkä küçerä, annan biremne torğızırğa "
"bula.</li>"
"<li><em>Taşla</em>biremne bötenläy taşlí</li></li></ul>"

#: behaviour.cpp:159
msgid "&Move to trash"
msgstr "Çüpkä &küçer"

#: behaviour.cpp:161
msgid "D&elete"
msgstr "&Beter"

#: browser.cpp:51
msgid "&Appearance"
msgstr "&Küreneş"

#: browser.cpp:52
msgid "&Behavior"
msgstr "&Eşlise eş"

#: browser.cpp:53
msgid "&Previews && Meta-Data"
msgstr "&Kürep Alu belän Meta-Eçtälek"

#: browser.cpp:57
msgid "&Quick Copy && Move"
msgstr "&Tiz Küpläw && Küçerü"

#: desktop.cpp:58
msgid ""
"<h1>Multiple Desktops</h1>In this module, you can configure how many virtual "
"desktops you want and how these should be labeled."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Küple Östäl</h1>Xíalí östäl sanı belän alarnıñ atamaların bu bülektä "
"bilgeläp bula."

#: desktop.cpp:71
msgid "N&umber of desktops: "
msgstr "Östäl öslär &sanı: "

#: desktop.cpp:77
msgid ""
"Here you can set how many virtual desktops you want on your KDE desktop. Move "
"the slider to change the value."
msgstr ""
"KDE östäl östendäge xíalí östäl sanın bonda bilgeläp bula. Sannı üzgärter öçen "
"şudırmanı quzğatası."

#: desktop.cpp:88
msgid "Desktop &Names"
msgstr "Östäl &Atamaları"

#: desktop.cpp:94 desktop.cpp:96
msgid "Desktop %1:"
msgstr "%1. Östäl:"

#: desktop.cpp:98 desktop.cpp:99 desktop.cpp:100 desktop.cpp:101
#, c-format
msgid "Here you can enter the name for desktop %1"
msgstr "%1 östäl östen bonda atap bula"

#: desktop.cpp:114
msgid "Mouse wheel over desktop background switches desktop"
msgstr "Östälneñ artyağında küse tägärmäçen äyländeregändä östäl almaşına"

#: desktop.cpp:224 desktop.cpp:242
#, c-format
msgid "Desktop %1"
msgstr "%1 Östäl"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:73
msgid "Sound Files"
msgstr "Tawış Biremnäre"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:133
msgid "&Left button:"
msgstr "&Sul töymä:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:134
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the left button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop:"
msgstr ""
"Çirtkeç cıhazıñnıñ sul töymäse belän östälgä çertkän çaqta närsä eşlärgä "
"kiräklegen saylarğa da bula:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:137
msgid "Right b&utton:"
msgstr "Uñ &töymä:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:138
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the right button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop:"
msgstr ""
"Çirtkeç cıhazıñnıñ uñ töymäse belän östälgä çertkän çaqta närsä eşlärgä "
"kiräklegen saylarğa da bula:"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:154 desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:200
msgid ""
" "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>No action:</em> as you might guess, nothing happens!</li> "
"<li><em>Window list menu:</em> a menu showing all windows on all virtual "
"desktops pops up. You can click on the desktop name to switch to that desktop, "
"or on a window name to shift focus to that window, switching desktops if "
"necessary, and restoring the window if it is hidden. Hidden or minimized "
"windows are represented with their names in parentheses.</li> "
"<li><em>Desktop menu:</em> a context menu for the desktop pops up. Among other "
"things, this menu has options for configuring the display, locking the screen, "
"and logging out of KDE.</li> "
"<li><em>Application menu:</em> the \"K\" menu pops up. This might be useful for "
"quickly accessing applications if you like to keep the panel (also known as "
"\"Kicker\") hidden from view.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
" "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Ğämäl Yuq:</em> añlağanıñ kebek, berni bulmas!</li> "
"<li><em>Täräzä tezmäse saylağı:</em> Böten xíalí östäl öslärendä böten "
"täräzälärne kürsätüçe saylaq qalqar. Östäl östenä küçär öçer östäl öste isemenä "
"basası; berär täräzäne (kiräk bulsa ikençe östäl östenä küçep, keçeräytelgän yä "
"ki yäşerelgän täräzäne cäyep) urtağa çığarır öçen täräzä isemenä basası. "
"Yäşerelgän yä ki keçeräytelgän täräzälär qapqalar eçendä kürsätelgän.</li> "
"<li><em>Östäl öste saylağı:</em> östäl östeneñ kontekst saylağı qalqar. "
"Başqalardan tış añarda ekrannı köylärgä, ekrannı yozaqlarğa, KDE'dan çığarğa "
"bula.</li> "
"<li><em>Aşırmalar saylağı:</em> \"K\" saylağı qalqar. Ayıruça \"Kicker\" "
"bularaq bilgele taqtanı yäşeren totarğa teläwçelärgä aşırmalarğa tiz ireşü öçen "
"faydalı bulır.</li></ul>"

#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:175
msgid ""
"You can choose what happens when you click the middle button of your pointing "
"device on the desktop: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>No action:</em> as you might guess, nothing happens!</li> "
"<li><em>Window list menu:</em> a menu showing all windows on all virtual "
"desktops pops up. You can click on the desktop name to switch to that desktop, "
"or on a window name to shift focus to that window, switching desktops if "
"necessary, and restoring the window if it is hidden. Hidden or minimized "
"windows are represented with their names in parentheses.</li> "
"<li><em>Desktop menu:</em> a context menu for the desktop pops up. Among other "
"things, this menu has options for configuring the display, locking the screen, "
"and logging out of KDE.</li> "
"<li><em>Application menu:</em> the \"K\" menu pops up. This might be useful for "
"quickly accessing applications if you like to keep the panel (also known as "
"\"Kicker\") hidden from view.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Östäl östendä küseneñ urta töymäsenä çirtüdän närsä bulaçağın saylí alasıñ: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Ğämäl Yuq:</em> añlağanıñ kebek, berni bulmas!</li> "
"<li><em>Täräzä tezmäse saylağı:</em> Böten xíalí östäl öslärendä böten "
"täräzälärne kürsätüçe saylaq qalqar. Östäl östenä küçär öçer östäl öste isemenä "
"basası; berär täräzäne (kiräk bulsa ikençe östäl östenä küçep, keçeräytelgän yä "
"ki yäşerelgän täräzäne cäyep) urtağa çığarır öçen täräzä isemenä basası. "
"Yäşerelgän yä ki keçeräytelgän täräzälär qapqalar eçendä kürsätelgän.</li> "
"<li><em>Östäl öste saylağı:</em> östäl östeneñ kontekst saylağı qalqar. "
"Başqalardan tış añarda ekrannı köylärgä, ekrannı yozaqlarğa, KDE'dan çığarğa "
"bula.</li> "
"<li><em>Aşırmalar saylağı:</em> \"K\" saylağı qalqar. Ayıruça \"Kicker\" "
"bularaq bilgele taqtanı yäşeren totarğa teläwçelärgä aşırmalarğa tiz ireşü öçen "
"faydalı bulır.</li></ul>"

