#: desktopbehavior_impl.cpp:467
msgid ""
"<h1>Behavior</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to choose various options\n"
"for your desktop, including the way in which icons are arranged and\n"
"the pop-up menus associated with clicks of the middle and right mouse\n"
"buttons on the desktop.\n"
"Use the \"Whats This?\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Qılanış</h1>\n"
" Bu bülektä östäldäge ikonnar urnaşu tärtiben,\n"
" qaysı küse ayağına basudan soñ qaysı qalquçı menu açıluın saylarğa bula.\n"
"Xosusí saylanmalar turında kübräk beler öçen \"Bu närsä\" (Shift+F1) qullanası."

#: fontopts.cpp:60
msgid "&Standard font:"
msgstr "&Standard şrift:"

#: fontopts.cpp:64
msgid "This is the font used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr "Bu - Konqueror täräzälärendä tekst kürsätelgändä qullanğan şrift."

#: fontopts.cpp:79
msgid "Font si&ze:"
msgstr "Ya&zu ülçäme:"

#: fontopts.cpp:87
msgid "This is the font size used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr ""
"Bu - Konqueror täräzälärendä tekst kürsätelgändä qullanğan şrift zurlığı."

#: fontopts.cpp:95
msgid "Normal te&xt color:"
msgstr "&Yazunıñ töp töse:"

#: fontopts.cpp:99
msgid "This is the color used to display text in Konqueror windows."
msgstr "Bu - Konqueror täräzälärendä tekst kürsätelgändä qullanılğan tös."

#: fontopts.cpp:126
msgid "&Text background color:"
msgstr "Yazunıñ ar&tyaq töse:"

#: fontopts.cpp:134
msgid "This is the color used behind the text for the icons on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Bu - östäl östendäge ikonnar tekstını kürsäter öçen artında qullanğan tös."

#: fontopts.cpp:146
msgid " lines"
msgstr " yul"

#: fontopts.cpp:147
msgid "1 line"
msgstr "1 yul"

#: fontopts.cpp:148
msgid "H&eight for icon text:"
msgstr "İkon yazması &bieklege:"

#: fontopts.cpp:154
msgid ""
"This is the maximum number of lines that can be used to draw icon text. Long "
"file names are truncated at the end of the last line."
msgstr ""
"Bu -ikon tekstı öçen kürsäteläçäk iñ zur yul sanı. Ozın birem isemnäre soñğı "
"yul soñında özeler."

#: fontopts.cpp:164
msgid " pixels"
msgstr " noqta"

#: fontopts.cpp:166
msgid "&Width for icon text:"
msgstr "İkon yazması &kiñlege:"

#: fontopts.cpp:172
msgid ""
"This is the maximum width for the icon text when konqueror is used in multi "
"column view mode."
msgstr ""
"Bu - konqueror küp bağana küreneñendä qullanğanda ikon tekstınıñ maksimum "
"kiñlege."

#: fontopts.cpp:180
msgid "&Underline filenames"
msgstr "Birem adın &sızası"

#: fontopts.cpp:184
msgid ""
"Checking this option will result in filenames being underlined, so that they "
"look like links on a web page. Note: to complete the analogy, make sure that "
"single click activation is enabled in the mouse control module."
msgstr ""
"Monı saylaw birem isemnäreneñ sıltamalar kebek assızılaçağına kiterer. Ämmä "
"oxşaşlıqnı tämamlar öçen küse idäräläre bülegendä yalğız çirtü belän açunı "
"sälätle itäse bar."

#: fontopts.cpp:193
msgid "Display file sizes in b&ytes"
msgstr "Birem külämen ba&ytlap kürsätäse"

#: fontopts.cpp:197
msgid ""
"Checking this option will result in file sizes being displayed in bytes. "
"Otherwise file sizes are being displayed in kilobytes or megabytes if "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, birem zurlıqlarınıñ baytlarda kürsäteler. Yuğisä birem zurlıqları "
"kilobayt häm megabaytlarda kürsäteler."

#: fontopts.cpp:390
msgid ""
"<h1>Appearance</h1> You can configure how Konqueror looks as a file manager "
"here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Küreneş</h1> birem idäräçe bularaq qullanıla torğan Konqueror küreneşen "
"monda köyläp bula."

#: previews.cpp:65
msgid ""
"<p>Allow previews, \"Folder Icons Reflect Contents\", and retrieval of "
"meta-data on protocols:</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Alküreneşlärne häm protokollardağı meta-birem kürsätelüne röxsät it:</p>"

#: previews.cpp:68
msgid ""
"<h1>Preview Options</h1> Here you can modify the behavior of Konqueror when it "
"shows the files in a folder."
"<h2>The list of protocols:</h2> check the protocols over which previews should "
"be shown; uncheck those over which they should not. For instance, you might "
"want to show previews over SMB if the local network is fast enough, but you "
"might disable it for FTP if you often visit very slow FTP sites with large "
"images."
"<h2>Maximum File Size:</h2> select the maximum file size for which previews "
"should be generated. For instance, if set to 1 MB (the default), no preview "
"will be generated for files bigger than 1 MB, for speed reasons."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Alküreneş Köylämäse</h1> Konquerornıñ törgäktäge fayllarnıñ kürsätü räweşen "
"monda köylärgä bula."
"<h2>Protokollar tezmäse:</h2> Alküreneşlärne bulaçaq häm bulmayaçaq "
"protokollarnı monda bilgeli alasıñ. Mäsälän, cirle çeltär citärlek tiz bulsa, "
"SMB öçen alküreneşlärne açıq qaldıra alasıñ; FTP säxifälärneñ kübese äkren "
"bulsa, FTP öçen alküreneñne sünderergä bula."
"<h2>Maksimum Birem Zurlığı:</h2>Alküreneş bulğan fayllarnıñ çikle zurlığın "
"bilgelä. Mäsälän, bu zurlıq 1 MB bulsa (bar bulğan), 1 MB'tan zurraq biremnär "
"öçen alküreneş çıqmas."

#: previews.cpp:81
msgid "Select Protocols"
msgstr "Protokollar Saylaw"

#: previews.cpp:89
msgid "Local Protocols"
msgstr "Cirle Protokol"

#: previews.cpp:91
msgid "Internet Protocols"
msgstr "İnternet Protokolı"

#: previews.cpp:119
msgid ""
"This option makes it possible to choose when the file previews, smart folder "
"icons, and meta-data in the File Manager should be activated.\n"
"In the list of protocols that appear, select which ones are fast enough for you "
"to allow previews to be generated."
msgstr ""
"Monda Birem Citäkçesendäge birem alküreneşläre, aqıllı törgäklär ikonnarı häm "
"meta-birem qaysı oçraqta açıq bulğanın bilgelärgä bula.\n"
"Kürengän Protokollar tezmäsennän alküreneşlär öçen citärlek tiz bulğannarın "
"sayla."

#: previews.cpp:124
msgid "&Maximum file size:"
msgstr "&Birem külämen çikläw:"

#: previews.cpp:128
msgid " MB"
msgstr " MB"

#: previews.cpp:135
msgid "&Increase size of previews relative to icons"
msgstr "İkonnarğa qarap alküreneşlär zurlığın arttır"

#: previews.cpp:139
msgid "&Use thumbnails embedded in files"
msgstr "Biremdäge almaşsürät q&ullanası"

#: previews.cpp:145
msgid ""
"Select this to use thumbnails that are found inside some file types (e.g. "
"JPEG). This will increase speed and reduce disk usage. Deselect it if you have "
"files that have been processed by programs which create inaccurate thumbnails, "
"such as ImageMagick."
msgstr ""
"Biremnärneñ JPEG kebek qayber törläre öçen alsürätlärne qullanır öçen monı "
"saylísı. Bolay tizlek artır häm disk qullanuı kimer. Yämsez/xatalı alsürätlär "
"bulğan biremnär bulu oçrağında bu saylanmanı töşer."

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 34
#: rc.cpp:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "Töptän"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 53
#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Show icons on desktop"
msgstr "İkonnarnı östäldä &kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 56
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Uncheck this option if you do not want to have icons on the desktop. Without "
"icons the desktop will be somewhat faster but you will no longer be able to "
"drag files to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Östäl östendä ikonnar telämäsäñ, monı tamğalama. Östäl östendä ikonnar "
"bulmağanda sistem tizräk eşlär, ämmä östäl östenä fayllarnı österäw artıq "
"mömkin bulmas."

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 92
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allow pro&grams in desktop window"
msgstr "Östäldä yazılımnarnı çığar&unı açası"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 95
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run X11 programs that draw into the desktop "
"such as xsnow, xpenguin or xmountain. If you have problems with applications "
"like netscape that check the root window for running instances, disable this "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Xsnow, Xpenguin, Xmountain kebek östäl östenä yazğan X11 yazılımnarın eşläwen "
"tä'min itär öçen monı sayla. Tamır täräzädäge cibärmälärne tikşergän Netscape "
"kebek yazılımnar belän bäläläreñ bulsa, bu saylanmanı sälätsez it."

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 105
#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show &tooltips"
msgstr "&Qoralkiñäş kürsätü"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 113
#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Bar at Top of Screen"
msgstr "Saylaq Tiräse Küräk Östendä"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 124
#: rc.cpp:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "&None"
msgstr "Yu&q"

#. i18n: file desktopbehavior.ui line 127
#: rc.cpp:27
