#: rootopts.cpp:67
msgid ""
"<h1>Paths</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to choose where in the filesystem the files on your "
"desktop should be stored.\n"
"Use the \"Whats This?\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Yullar</h1>\n"
"Bu bülektä östäl östendäge biremnärneñ qaysı töştä saqlísın saylap bula.\n"
"Xosusí saylanmalar turında kiñäş alır öçen \"Ni Bu\" (Shift+F1) qullanası."

#: rootopts.cpp:74
msgid "Des&ktop path:"
msgstr "Östäl &törgägenä yul:"

#: rootopts.cpp:81
msgid ""
"This folder contains all the files which you see on your desktop. You can "
"change the location of this folder if you want to, and the contents will move "
"automatically to the new location as well."
msgstr ""
"Östäl östendä bulğan bar biremnäre dä bu törgäktä yata. Anıñ yulı  "
"almaştırılğan çaqta, anıñ eçtälege dä üzennän üze yaña urınğa küçä."

#: rootopts.cpp:89
msgid "A&utostart path:"
msgstr "Ü&zennän cibärelü yulı:"

#: rootopts.cpp:96
msgid ""
"This folder contains applications or links to applications (shortcuts) that you "
"want to have started automatically whenever KDE starts. You can change the "
"location of this folder if you want to, and the contents will move "
"automatically to the new location as well."
msgstr ""
"KDE cibärelgän sayın üzennän üze cibäräse yazılımlar yä ki alarğa çaptırmalar "
"bu törgäktä yata. Anıñ yulı almaştırılğan çaqta, anıñ eçtälege dä üzennän üze "
"yaña urınğa küçä."

#: rootopts.cpp:105
msgid "D&ocuments path:"
msgstr "&İstäleklär yulı:"

#: rootopts.cpp:112
msgid ""
"This folder will be used by default to load or save documents from or to."
msgstr "İstäleklärne yöklär yä ki saqlar öçen bu törgäk qullanılaçaq."

